Other players can see your username, avatar, and training stats on the leaderboard, in friend lists, and on teams. When you use these features you agree not to:

• pick a username or avatar that is offensive, hateful, sexual, or includes your real full name, phone number, address, school, or other contact details;
• harass, bully, threaten, or spam other users, including through friend requests;
• impersonate another person, coach, team, or BravoBall;
• share anyone's personal contact information;
• cheat or manipulate points, streaks, or the leaderboard.

To report abuse or a player who breaks these rules, email team@conklinofficial.com. We may change offending usernames and remove users from the leaderboard, friends, or teams.
